  <string src="File Manager 0.8&#10;&#10;Made by Wolff, File Manager is a file explorer for the PS Vita that brings together what VitaShell and FileManager Vita (FMVita, a fork of VitaShell) can do, in the system's own interface: the same menus, sounds and transitions as Sony's apps.&#10;&#10;Built with: ScePaf, the system UI framework (reverse engineering by GrapheneCt); NetStream and BetterHomebrewBrowser as references; VitaShell by TheFloW; ftpvita by xerpi; libarchive, libpng, zlib and libmad. Icons: Icons8.&#10;&#10;Licensed under GPLv3." id="msg_about_text" />
